    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443">

                <pb facs="0429" n="313" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg313"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.6112/5.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 346.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 22, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to previous correspondence in
                    regard to the Zapata Swamp Concession, and particularly to my telegram of July
                    19, and <pb facs="0430" n="314" xml:id="pg314"/> the Department’s reply of July
                    20, I have the honor to enclose herewith, in copy and translation, the text of
                    President Gómez’s note to me dated July 19<anchor n="1" xml:id="d443-f1"/> and
                    copy of my reply, dated July 20, sent in obedience to the Department’s
                    instruction. I had already sent to the Department, with my despatch No. 343 of
                    July 18, a copy and translation of my first note to President Gómez on this
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. M. Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d443-a1.xml" xpointer="d443-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d443-f1" n="1" xml:id="d443-f1-content">
                <p>Identical with text contained in the Minister’s telegram of July 19, above.</p>
            </note>
